{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "ss-go-quests-collection",
		"name": "SS-GO.quests",
		"description": "Phase 2 — Quest System endpoints for SS-GO platform.\n\nTickets: P2-T13, P2-T14, P2-T15\n\n## Concepts\n- **QuestChain** — An ordered or parallel group of quests (e.g. tutorial chain, story arc).\n- **QuestDefinition** — A single quest with compound AND/OR win-conditions, rewards (coins/items), and optional chain linkage.\n- **PlayerQuestProgress** — Per-player state for a quest: progress_data (per-clause), status (in_progress / completed / claimed / expired).\n- **QuestRewardClaim** — Immutable receipt once a player claims a completed quest reward (idempotent via idempotency_key).\n\n## Progress Flow\n1. Server-side usecases (login, gacha, inventory) call `QuestService.RecordQuestEvent` internally — NOT exposed to clients.\n2. Quests whose condition tree is satisfied are auto-marked `completed`.\n3. Player calls `POST /api/v1/games/{game_id}/quests/{quest_id}/claim` to collect rewards.\n\n## Routing Summary\n  POST   /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-chains                              (admin)\n  GET    /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-chains                              (admin)\n  PATCH  /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-chains/{chain_id}                   (admin)\n  DELETE /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-chains/{chain_id}                   (admin)\n  POST   /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-definitions                         (admin)\n  GET    /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-definitions                         (admin)\n  GET    /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-definitions/{quest_id}              (admin)\n  PATCH  /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-definitions/{quest_id}              (admin)\n  DELETE /api/v1/studios/{studio_id}/games/{game_id}/quest-definitions/{quest_id}              (admin)\n  GET    /api/v1/games/{game_id}/quests                                                        (player)\n  GET    /api/v1/games/{game_id}/quest-chains/{chain_id}                                       (player)\n  POST   /api/v1/games/{game_id}/quests/{quest_id}/claim                                       (player)\n  GET    /api/v1/games/{game_id}/quest-claims                                                  (player)\n\nBase URL: {{api_url}} (default: http://localhost:8080)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "ss-go-platform"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Admin — Quest Chains",
			"description": "Manage quest chains (groups of quests). Requires `quest:write` or `quest:read` permission.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Create Quest Chain",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (!pm.environment.get('access_token')) console.log('⚠ access_token not set');",
									"if (!pm.environment.get('studio_id')) console.log('⚠ studio_id not set');",
									"if (!pm.environment.get('game_id')) console.log('⚠ game_id not set');"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
									"pm.test('Has id', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('id'));",
									"const j = pm.response.json();",
									"if (j.id) { pm.environment.set('quest_chain_id', j.id); console.log('✓ quest_chain_id:', j.id); }"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"chain_key\": \"tutorial_chain\",\n    \"display_name\": \"Tutorial Chain\",\n    \"description\": \"Introductory quest chain for new players.\",\n    \"chain_type\": \"sequential\",\n    \"is_active\": true\n}",
							"options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/studios/{{studio_id}}/games/{{game_id}}/quest-chains",
							"host": ["{{api_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "studios", "{{studio_id}}", "games", "{{game_id}}", "quest-chains"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "List Quest Chains",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"pm.test('Has chains array', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('chains'));"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/studios/{{studio_id}}/games/{{game_id}}/quest-chains?limit=50&offset=0",
							"host": ["{{api_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "studios", "{{studio_id}}", "games", "{{game_id}}", "quest-chains"],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "limit", "value": "50" },
								{ "key": "offset", "value": "0" }
							]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Update Quest Chain",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "PATCH",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"display_name\": \"Tutorial Chain (Updated)\",\n    \"description\": \"Updated description.\",\n    \"is_active\": true\n}",
							"options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/studios/{{studio_id}}/games/{{game_id}}/quest-chains/{{quest_chain_id}}",
							"host": ["{{api_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "studios", "{{studio_id}}", "games", "{{game_id}}", "quest-chains", "{{quest_chain_id}}"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Delete Quest Chain",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/studios/{{studio_id}}/games/{{game_id}}/quest-chains/{{quest_chain_id}}",
							"host": ["{{api_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "studios", "{{studio_id}}", "games", "{{game_id}}", "quest-chains", "{{quest_chain_id}}"]
						}
					}
				}
			]
		},
